WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.032 --> 00:00:03.276
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:05.797
What do they see?

3
00:00:05.798 --> 00:00:10.726
They see a pizza place.

4
00:00:10.727 --> 00:00:24.718
The blobs go into the kitchen.

5
00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:41.086
They toss three balls of dough.

6
00:00:41.087 --> 00:00:56.666
They put sauce on three pizzas.

7
00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:10.978
They put cheese on three pizzas.

8
00:01:10.979 --> 00:01:29.237
They put toppings on three pizzas.

9
00:01:29.238 --> 00:01:37.342
It's time to bake their pizzas.

10
00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:56.703
Oh no! Two pizzas fall to the floor.

11
00:01:56.704 --> 00:02:12.163
But one goes into the oven!

12
00:02:12.164 --> 00:02:26.782
The blobs share the pizza.

13
00:02:26.783 --> 00:02:33.217
Silly blobs.

14
00:02:33.218 --> 00:02:37.596
Good-bye!

